[en.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_AMULET_NAME]
Queen Trixie Lulamoon

[en.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_AMULET_DESC]
No pony knows the exact origin of Trixie Lulamoon. A slightly credible statement is that she was born in Las Pegasus, and once studied at the School for Gifted Unicorns. She chose to travel alone because of the differences in magic performance ideas with her father. Some ponies say she was the queen of Diamondia, some say she was the warrior who defeated the Ursa Major, and some say she was just an arrogant third-rate trickster magician.
She once ruled Ponyville, which lasted only one day, but she sincerely repented in the end and was forgiven by the residents, including 【CENSORED】 and her friends. Later, she became friends with Starlight Glimmer and together they stopped an invasion of Changelings. When the Ultimate Battle broke out, Trixie was responsible for evacuating the residents, avoiding heavy casualties in Ponyville. Her respectful attitude towards Cozy Glow made her the temporary head of security, and in the following years, through excellent political balancing, an unexpected train accident, a stupid war, and a strange treaty, Trixie was promoted again and again, and was officially ennobled as the Duchess of Ponyville with the support of the citizens.
Now, just one Duchess title is no longer enough for her. Duchess Trixie? Call me Queen Trixie! The great and omnipotent queen of Ponyville and Diamondia!

[zh.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_AMULET_NAME]
特丽克西·卢拉月女王

[zh.CHARACTER_TRIXIE_LULAMOON_AMULET_DESC]
没有小马清楚特丽克西·卢拉月具体的来历，一个稍微可信的说法是她出生在洛马基，还曾经在天才独角兽学院里学习过，因为和父亲在魔术表演理念上的差异选择了独自云游四方。有小马称她曾是宝石王国的女王，也有传说说她是击败了大熊的勇士，还有说法是她只是个狂妄自大的三流骗子魔术师。
她曾经统治过小马谷，她的统治仅仅持续了一天时间，但她最后真心悔过，并得到了包括【已和谐】和她的朋友们在内的居民们的原谅。后来她成了星光熠熠的朋友，并与无序一同阻止了一次幻形灵的入侵。而在终局之战爆发时，特丽克西认真负责地执行了自己疏散居民的工作，避免了小马谷在战争中遭受到太大伤亡。而她之后对和煦光流毕恭毕敬的态度也使得她顺利成为了临时安保队长，在之后的几年里，靠着出色的政治平衡术，一场意外的列车事故，一场愚蠢的战争，以及一纸奇怪的条约，特丽克西连连晋升，在民众的支持下被正式册封为小马谷公爵。
如今，单单一个爵位也已经不足以满足她了，特丽克西公爵？请叫我特丽克西女王！小马谷与宝石王国的伟大又全能的女王！
